<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Triple Threat 3-On-3 Basketball Tournament </h1>
<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;"><strong><a href="https:/www.quickscores.com/Orgs/Forms.php?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21ecMUvC8IhGqUYsaLlr8sWrKeHov1ytZcnxG85ZWPRVnhtFdlPlHdREQGmtmHyGVAtsff6cIHqSKN6Dh282Si4fMwyjSthDlYRQ%24=&FormDefID=35925&OrgDir=crpdsports&task=view&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Triple Threat registration" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Register today</a>!</strong></h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">You won't want to miss a brand-new program that aims to teach the City’s youth important skills in a fun way using sports! The deadline to register is Tuesday, Aug. 1.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Inspire Sports, a Parks and Protectors Alliance, kicks off next month with the Triple Threat 3-On-3 Basketball Tournament. Inspire Sports is a unique collaboration between Columbus Division of Police, Columbus Division of Fire and Columbus Recreation and Parks Department. The program moves beyond the game and uses sports to help youth develop the skills needed to be successful in life. First responders mentor youth through sports leagues, tournaments and events. Your student will love this event! </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>What: </strong>Triple Threat 3-On-3 Basketball Tournament<strong><br><strong>Who</strong></strong>: Youth ages 12-14<br><strong>When</strong>: Saturday, Aug. 5, from 10 a.m.-3 p.m.<br><strong>Where</strong>: Columbus Fire Academy, 3639 Parsons Ave., 43207<br><strong>Cost</strong>: $20 for a four-person team<br><strong>Deadline to Register:</strong> Tuesday, Aug. 1</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">All teams are guaranteed to play three games, and they will receive lunch and giveaways. The community is invited to watch the competition, and enjoy attractions, food trucks, music and more!</p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong><a href="https:/www.quickscores.com/Orgs/Forms.php?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21ecMUvC8IhGqUYsaLlr8sWrKeHov1ytZcnxG85ZWPRVnhtFdlPlHdREQGmtmHyGVAtsff6cIHqSKN6Dh282Si4fMwyjSthDlYRQ%24=&FormDefID=35925&OrgDir=crpdsports&task=view&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Triple Threat registration" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Register today</a>! Space is limited!</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/wellness/athletics/inspire-sports/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Insprire Sports" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Learn more about Inspire Sports</a>.</p>
